{
  "_comment": "GOLDEN FIXTURE: M005 still fires. Refunds and Preferences are fact tables whose names merely contain the letters ref; a substring match took them for reference/dimension tables and hid the finding.",
  "model": {
    "tables": [
      {
        "name": "Refunds",
